# ==============================================================================
# ✒ Metadata
#     - Title: GitIgnore (Terrane Edition - v1.1)
#     - File Name: .gitignore
#     - Relative Path: .gitignore
#     - Artifact Type: config
#     - Version: 1.1.0
#     - Date: 11/11/2026
#     - Update: Wednesday, November 11, 2026
#     - Author: Dennis 'dendogg' Smaltz
#     - A.I. Acknowledgement: Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5
#     - Signature: ︻デ═─── ✦ ✦ ✦ | Aim Twice, Shoot Once!
#
# ✒ Changelog:
#     - 1.1.0 (11/11/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5] —
#       Ignores .dev/, the local development settings.
#     - 1.0.0 (11/11/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5] —
#       Initial release.
#
# ✒ Description:
#     Git ignore patterns for Terrane. Excludes dependency folders, logs,
#     editor and OS clutter, local secrets, local development settings, and
#     any holding area or journal that a test run or a launch against the
#     project itself leaves behind. The vendored three.js and fonts in web/
#     are source and stay tracked. Snapshots and thumbnails live outside the
#     project entirely.
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: none
#     - Compatible platforms: Git on Windows, macOS, Linux
# ==============================================================================

# Dependencies (there are none today; this keeps it that way by accident too)
node_modules/

# Terrane's own state, if the service is ever pointed at this directory
.terrane-trash/

# Logs, caches and scratch output
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tmp
__pycache__/
.scratch/

# Local secrets and machine settings
.env
.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# OS and sync clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*

# Local development state: the mirrored target and its settings
.dev/
